  "title": "Hurricane Florence Command Update",
  "description": "Col. Scott Baldwin, Deputy Commander of Marine Corps Installations East and SgtMaj. Charles Metzger, MCI East Sergeant Major give a command update on the current housing situation on Marine Corps Base Camp Lejeune and Marine Air Station New River, Sept. 27, 2018. Hurricane Florence impacted MCB Camp Lejeune and Marine Corps Air Station New River with periods of strong winds, heavy rains, flooding of urban and low lying areas, flash floods and coastal storm surges. (U.S. Marine Corps Video by Lance Cpl. Antonio Garcia)",
  "keywords": "II Marine Expeditionary Force, Jacksonville",
