  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 3.68,
      "e": 4.51,
      "text": "- Good Afternoon."
    },
    {
      "s": 4.51,
      "e": 5.53,
      "text": "I'm Colonel Scott Baldwin."
    },
    {
      "s": 5.53,
      "e": 6.8,
      "text": "I'm the Deputy Commander"
    },
    {
      "s": 6.8,
      "e": 8.18,
      "text": "for Marine Corps Installations East"
    },
    {
      "s": 8.18,
      "e": 10.44,
      "text": "and Marine Corps Base Camp Lejeune."
    },
    {
      "s": 10.44,
      "e": 11.99,
      "text": "I'm here with Sar Major Metzger."
    },
    {
      "s": 11.99,
      "e": 12.82,
      "text": "The Sargent Major"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.82,
      "e": 14.11,
      "text": "for the MCI East and"
    },
    {
      "s": 14.11,
      "e": 15.33,
      "text": "Marine Corps base."
    },
    {
      "s": 15.33,
      "e": 16.56,
      "text": "We're here at one of the homes"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.56,
      "e": 17.39,
      "text": "you can see behind us."
    },
    {
      "s": 17.39,
      "e": 19.48,
      "text": "That received some devastating impacts"
    },
    {
      "s": 19.48,
      "e": 20.77,
      "text": "from Hurricane Florence."
    },
    {
      "s": 20.77,
      "e": 21.77,
      "text": "As you know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.77,
      "e": 23.78,
      "text": "Hurricane Florence was one of the largest storms"
    },
    {
      "s": 23.78,
      "e": 24.82,
      "text": "and strongest storms"
    },
    {
      "s": 24.82,
      "e": 25.74,
      "text": "that hit us"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.21,
      "e": 27.04,
      "text": "in years."
    },
    {
      "s": 27.04,
      "e": 28.38,
      "text": "I've talked to locals"
    },
    {
      "s": 28.38,
      "e": 30.68,
      "text": "who've been here for thirty plus years."
    },
    {
      "s": 30.68,
      "e": 31.99,
      "text": "And although it did come ashore"
    },
    {
      "s": 31.99,
      "e": 33.49,
      "text": "as a category one,"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.06,
      "e": 35.32,
      "text": "they saw a category three's"
    },
    {
      "s": 35.32,
      "e": 36.7,
      "text": "come through here years ago."
    },
    {
      "s": 36.7,
      "e": 37.97,
      "text": "But this one was very unique"
    },
    {
      "s": 37.97,
      "e": 39.49,
      "text": "just in the way that it was"
    },
    {
      "s": 39.49,
      "e": 40.66,
      "text": "it was formed,"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.95,
      "e": 42.54,
      "text": "and the way it came across our shore,"
    },
    {
      "s": 42.54,
      "e": 44.56,
      "text": "and how it moved really slowly"
    },
    {
      "s": 44.56,
      "e": 46.05,
      "text": "and was over the area for so long"
    },
    {
      "s": 46.05,
      "e": 48.8,
      "text": "and we had these sustained winds,"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.85,
      "e": 51.56,
      "text": "and all the devastation that came along with that."
    },
    {
      "s": 51.56,
      "e": 52.61,
      "text": "And I will tell you,"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.61,
      "e": 53.73,
      "text": "as most of you have seen"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.73,
      "e": 55.69,
      "text": "driving around the installation here."
    },
    {
      "s": 55.69,
      "e": 57.06,
      "text": "There was a lot of devastation"
    },
    {
      "s": 57.06,
      "e": 58.66,
      "text": "and we're very quickly"
    },
    {
      "s": 58.66,
      "e": 60.55,
      "text": "trying to dig our way out."
    },
    {
      "s": 60.55,
      "e": 62.64,
      "text": "We treat it similar like a triage"
    },
    {
      "s": 62.64,
      "e": 63.76,
      "text": "where were starting out saying"
    },
    {
      "s": 63.76,
      "e": 65.01,
      "text": "\"What's the worst"
    },
    {
      "s": 65.01,
      "e": 67.87,
      "text": "and how do we get those taken care of first?\""
    },
    {
      "s": 67.87,
      "e": 69.4,
      "text": "And then move our way"
    },
    {
      "s": 69.4,
      "e": 70.57,
      "text": "down the line."
    },
    {
      "s": 70.67,
      "e": 72.89,
      "text": "So we will get to everything."
    },
    {
      "s": 72.89,
      "e": 75.52,
      "text": "It just may take a little bit of time."
    },
    {
      "s": 75.52,
      "e": 76.7,
      "text": "And we need your patience"
    },
    {
      "s": 76.7,
      "e": 78.7,
      "text": "and your support to one,"
    },
    {
      "s": 78.71,
      "e": 80.3,
      "text": "help us to help you"
    },
    {
      "s": 81.32,
      "e": 83.47,
      "text": "and then ask that you help yourselves"
    },
    {
      "s": 83.47,
      "e": 84.8,
      "text": "as your doing this."
    },
    {
      "s": 84.8,
      "e": 86.05,
      "text": "Little things like"
    },
    {
      "s": 86.05,
      "e": 87.56,
      "text": "uh inside if you see you have"
    },
    {
      "s": 87.56,
      "e": 88.74,
      "text": "some water damage."
    },
    {
      "s": 88.74,
      "e": 90.16,
      "text": "Those AMCC folks,"
    },
    {
      "s": 90.27,
      "e": 91.1,
      "text": "the housing folks"
    },
    {
      "s": 91.1,
      "e": 91.94,
      "text": "they're going to come around"
    },
    {
      "s": 91.94,
      "e": 93.84,
      "text": "and they're going to get to you eventually"
    },
    {
      "s": 93.84,
      "e": 94.97,
      "text": "to look at your water damage"
    },
    {
      "s": 94.97,
      "e": 96.4,
      "text": "and make an assessment."
    },
    {
      "s": 96.4,
      "e": 97.23,
      "text": "So with that,"
    },
    {
      "s": 97.23,
      "e": 98.06,
      "text": "Sargent Major."
    },
    {
      "s": 98.06,
      "e": 98.9,
      "text": "- It's been two weeks"
    },
    {
      "s": 98.9,
      "e": 99.88,
      "text": "since that storm has come through"
    },
    {
      "s": 99.88,
      "e": 101.23,
      "text": "and hit us out there."
    },
    {
      "s": 101.23,
      "e": 102.23,
      "text": "But one thing were committed to"
    },
    {
      "s": 102.23,
      "e": 104.91,
      "text": "is making sure that we give people accurate information."
    },
    {
      "s": 104.91,
      "e": 106.79,
      "text": "We have to make sure that our recovery efforts"
    },
    {
      "s": 106.79,
      "e": 108.04,
      "text": "are also united towards"
    },
    {
      "s": 108.04,
      "e": 109.76,
      "text": "the greater good of all."
    },
    {
      "s": 109.76,
      "e": 111.31,
      "text": "So what we ask you to is"
    },
    {
      "s": 111.31,
      "e": 113.62,
      "text": "make sure you understand that we hear you,"
    },
    {
      "s": 113.62,
      "e": 114.56,
      "text": "we understand your concerns"
    },
    {
      "s": 114.56,
      "e": 115.94,
      "text": "and we're committed to you."
    },
    {
      "s": 115.94,
      "e": 116.93,
      "text": "We're here to make sure that"
    },
    {
      "s": 116.93,
      "e": 118.64,
      "text": "Marine Corps Base Camp Lejeune"
    },
    {
      "s": 118.64,
      "e": 120.84,
      "text": "is safe for all our service members,"
    },
    {
      "s": 120.84,
      "e": 122.33,
      "text": "families and civilian employees"
    },
    {
      "s": 122.33,
      "e": 125.27,
      "text": "who live and work aboard Camp Lejeune."
    },
    {
      "s": 125.27,
      "e": 126.1,
      "text": "- Alright so,"
    },
    {
      "s": 126.1,
      "e": 128.78,
      "text": "\"How can you help us to help you?\""
    },
    {
      "s": 128.78,
      "e": 129.67,
      "text": "Well I will tell you"
    },
    {
      "s": 129.67,
      "e": 131.38,
      "text": "one of the greatest mediums out there"
    },
    {
      "s": 131.38,
      "e": 132.46,
      "text": "is social media."
    },
    {
      "s": 132.46,
      "e": 134.85,
      "text": "Right now we have our comstrat office"
    },
    {
      "s": 134.85,
      "e": 135.92,
      "text": "and they're monitoring"
    },
    {
      "s": 135.92,
      "e": 138.17,
      "text": "and watching social media sites"
    },
    {
      "s": 138.17,
      "e": 139.0,
      "text": "all day"
    },
    {
      "s": 139.0,
      "e": 140.06,
      "text": "every single day."
    },
    {
      "s": 140.06,
      "e": 142.28,
      "text": "They may not get an answer to you immediately"
    },
    {
      "s": 142.28,
      "e": 145.14,
      "text": "or be responsive like you might expect them"
    },
    {
      "s": 145.14,
      "e": 146.21,
      "text": "to be responsive."
    },
    {
      "s": 146.21,
      "e": 147.36,
      "text": "But we will get to it."
    },
    {
      "s": 147.36,
      "e": 148.34,
      "text": "And we are going to use those."
    },
    {
      "s": 148.34,
      "e": 149.74,
      "text": "We value your imput,"
    },
    {
      "s": 149.74,
      "e": 151.41,
      "text": "and we can put all those together"
    },
    {
      "s": 151.41,
      "e": 152.76,
      "text": "and really will help us"
    },
    {
      "s": 152.76,
      "e": 155.23,
      "text": "as we go through this triage process."
    },
    {
      "s": 155.23,
      "e": 157.16,
      "text": "So if you can imagine this is one"
    },
    {
      "s": 157.16,
      "e": 159.41,
      "text": "of over five thousand homes"
    },
    {
      "s": 159.71,
      "e": 160.83,
      "text": "on the Camp Lejeune"
    },
    {
      "s": 160.83,
      "e": 162.0,
      "text": "and Marine Corps Air station,"
    },
    {
      "s": 162.0,
      "e": 164.0,
      "text": "New River Installations."
    },
    {
      "s": 164.2,
      "e": 166.21,
      "text": "So as we slowly get through these"
    },
    {
      "s": 166.21,
      "e": 168.21,
      "text": "there's more then 100 homes"
    },
    {
      "s": 168.21,
      "e": 169.61,
      "text": "that looks similar to this"
    },
    {
      "s": 169.61,
      "e": 171.61,
      "text": "with severe devestation."
    },
    {
      "s": 171.86,
      "e": 173.54,
      "text": "Those families are being worked with"
    },
    {
      "s": 173.54,
      "e": 174.94,
      "text": "on a case by case basis"
    },
    {
      "s": 174.94,
      "e": 176.49,
      "text": "to get them relocated"
    },
    {
      "s": 176.49,
      "e": 178.71,
      "text": "uh and back to what we would consider"
    },
    {
      "s": 178.71,
      "e": 179.85,
      "text": "to be a normal life."
    },
    {
      "s": 179.85,
      "e": 181.31,
      "text": "So please be patient."
    },
    {
      "s": 181.31,
      "e": 182.47,
      "text": "Brigadier General Alford,"
    },
    {
      "s": 182.47,
      "e": 183.37,
      "text": "the Commanding General"
    },
    {
      "s": 183.37,
      "e": 184.97,
      "text": "is committed to you,"
    },
    {
      "s": 184.97,
      "e": 186.65,
      "text": "he's committed to this community,"
    },
    {
      "s": 186.65,
      "e": 187.48,
      "text": "and he's committed"
    },
    {
      "s": 187.48,
      "e": 189.9,
      "text": "to every individual service member"
    },
    {
      "s": 189.9,
      "e": 191.55,
      "text": "and their family to make sure"
    },
    {
      "s": 191.55,
      "e": 193.05,
      "text": "that their taken care of."
    },
    {
      "s": 193.05,
      "e": 194.93,
      "text": "Just please be patient with us"
    },
    {
      "s": 194.93,
      "e": 196.96,
      "text": "it could take a little bit of time."
    },
    {
      "s": 196.96,
      "e": 198.26,
      "text": "Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "s": 198.26,
      "e": 199.09,
      "text": "- Oorah"
    },
    {
      "s": 199.09,
      "e": 200.01,
      "text": "- Semper Fi"
    }
  ],
